UERANSIM v3.3.0 | 5G-SA UE implementation | Copyright (c) 2026 ALİ GÜNGÖR
Usage:
  nr-ue -c <config-file> [option...]

Options:
  -c, --config <config-file>  Use specified configuration file for UE
  -i, --imsi <imsi>           Use specified IMSI number instead of provided one
  -n, --num-of-UE <num>       Generate specified number of UEs starting from the given IMSI
  -t, --tempo <tempo>         Starting delay in milliseconds for each of the UEs
  -l, --disable-cmd           Disable command line functionality for this instance
  -r, --no-routing-config     Do not auto configure routing for UE TUN interface
  -h, --help                  Show this help message and exit
  -v, --version               Show version information and exit
